WEBVTT

00:02.493 --> 00:05.121
ARE YA READY, KIDS?
孩子们，准备好了吗？

00:05.204 --> 00:06.539
I CAN'T  HEAR  YOU.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.622 --> 00:08.833
Kids:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN.
孩子们：
是的，是的，队长。

00:08.916 --> 00:11.711
♪ OHH... ♪
♪ 噢...♪

00:11.794 --> 00:13.713
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.796 --> 00:15.840
Kids: ♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.923 --> 00:17.633
Captain: ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
船长：♪ 吸水的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.717 --> 00:19.677
Kids: ♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.761 --> 00:21.721
Captain: ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHIN' YOU WISH ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.804 --> 00:23.723
Kids: ♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.806 --> 00:25.600
Captain: ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
船长：♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.683 --> 00:27.018
Kids: ♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:27.101 --> 00:28.352
Captain: ♪ READY? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:28.436 --> 00:29.604
All: ♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.687 --> 00:31.731
♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.814 --> 00:33.733
♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.816 --> 00:37.236
Captain: ♪ SPONGEBOB
SQUAREPANTS ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:52.502 --> 00:55.296
LET'S GO!
我们走吧！

00:58.341 --> 00:59.759
HEY, KIDS.
嘿，孩子们。

00:59.842 --> 01:04.055
RUSH HOUR TRAFFIC HERE IN ENCINO
IS A REAL BRINGDOWN.
恩西诺的高峰时段交通
这是一个真正的打击。

01:05.681 --> 01:08.518
SOME MUSIC SHOULD SOOTHE
ME JANGLED NERVE.
一些音乐可以舒缓情绪
我的神经紧张。

01:08.601 --> 01:11.395
AT LEAST ME IN-DASH
HI-FI STILL WORKS.
至少我在仪表板中
HI-FI 仍然有效。

01:12.730 --> 01:14.482
OH!
哦！

01:14.565 --> 01:19.111
ME ULTRA-RARE
"FRAMPTON COMES ALIVE"
EIGHT-TRACK, DESTROYED.
我超稀有
“弗兰普顿复活了”
八轨，已毁。

01:19.195 --> 01:24.283
AND I'M GONNA MISS
THE NEW SPONGEBOB CARTOON IF
THIS TRAFFIC DOESN'T MOVE SOON.
我会想念
新海绵宝宝卡通 IF
这种交通不会很快移动。

01:30.498 --> 01:32.291
WHO'S CALLING?
谁在打电话？

01:32.375 --> 01:33.960
YES, PATCHY HERE.
是的，这里不完整。

01:34.043 --> 01:35.044
START SQUAWKIN'.
开始尖叫。

01:36.170 --> 01:37.588
HEY, PATCHY.
嘿，斑驳的。

01:37.672 --> 01:38.965
NEW SPONGEBOB CARTOON'S
ABOUT TO START.
新海绵宝宝卡通
即将开始。

01:39.048 --> 01:39.966
WHERE ARE YOU?
你在哪里？

01:41.050 --> 01:42.468
STUCK ON THE 101.
卡在 101 上。

01:42.552 --> 01:44.262
BE A DEAR AND RECORD IT FOR ME,
WOULD YOU?
亲爱的，为我记录下来，
你愿意吗？

01:44.345 --> 01:47.139
OH, I THREW THAT OLD
BETAMAX MACHINE IN THE GARBAGE.
哦，我把那个旧的扔了
垃圾中的 BETAMAX 机器。

01:48.224 --> 01:49.433
YOU WHAT?
你什么？

01:49.517 --> 01:51.310
OH, CALM DOWN, "BEARDY."
哦，冷静点，“大胡子。”

01:51.394 --> 01:55.940
POTTY, YOU KNOW HOW IMPORTANT
THIS CARTOON IS TO ME.
便盆，你知道有多重要
这幅漫画适合我。

01:59.110 --> 02:01.362
DO YOU MIND?
你介意吗？

02:01.445 --> 02:04.574
I'M TRYING TO TALK TO MY PARROT!
我正在尝试和我的鹦鹉说话！

02:07.952 --> 02:09.078
SORRY, POTTY.
对不起，便盆。

02:09.161 --> 02:10.413
JUST SOME LANDLUBBER.
只是一些旱鸭子。

02:11.497 --> 02:12.540
POTTY?
便壶？

02:12.623 --> 02:15.334
HELLO, HELLO, HELLO, HELLO?
你好，你好，你好，你好？

02:16.544 --> 02:18.421
DROPPED AGAIN.
再次掉落。

02:18.504 --> 02:23.759
CURSE THIS TRAFFIC!
诅咒这种交通！

02:23.843 --> 02:26.929
OOH!
哦！

02:39.150 --> 02:41.194
ARGH, HOME AT LAST.
啊啊，终于到家了。

02:41.277 --> 02:47.033
WHAT THE...?
什么是...？

02:47.116 --> 02:49.869
ENCINO.
恩西诺。

02:49.952 --> 02:53.331
IT'S GONE.
它消失了。

02:53.414 --> 02:59.629
NO!
不！

03:03.341 --> 03:08.763
YOU KNOW, KIDS, THIS KIND OF
REMINDS PATCHY OF AN OLD STORY,
你知道，孩子们，这种
让人想起一个古老的故事，

03:08.846 --> 03:13.142
ANOTHER STORY ABOUT A LOST CITY.
另一个关于失落之城的故事。

03:13.225 --> 03:15.269
WHY DON'T YOU CHECK IT OUT?
你为什么不检查一下？

03:17.313 --> 03:20.107
ENCINO.
恩西诺。

03:38.334 --> 03:40.461
A BEAUTIFUL SPECIMEN, SPONGEBOB.
一个美丽的标本，海绵宝宝。

03:40.544 --> 03:41.963
HURRY, PATRICK, HURRY!
快点，帕特里克，快点！

03:42.046 --> 03:43.589
OH.
哦。

03:43.673 --> 03:45.591
HOW'S IT LOOK, BUDDY?
看起来怎么样，伙计？

03:45.675 --> 03:47.426
READY FOR THE OLD SCRAPBOOK?
准备好旧剪贴簿了吗？

03:47.510 --> 03:48.427
MORE LIKE THE SCRAP HEAP.
更像是废料堆。

03:48.511 --> 03:49.428
HM.
嗯。

03:49.512 --> 03:51.138
THEY NEVER COME OUT RIGHT.
他们永远不会表现得正确。

03:51.222 --> 03:52.223
OH, WELL.
那好吧。

03:52.306 --> 03:53.808
LET'S TRY AGAIN.
让我们再试一次。

03:53.891 --> 03:56.602
OK, FRIEND, THIS IS GONNA
BE MY MASTERPIECE.
好的，朋友，这就是
成为我的杰作。

03:56.686 --> 04:00.940
I'M READY,  .
我准备好了，。

04:01.023 --> 04:04.276
HI, PATRICK.
嗨，帕特里克。

04:04.360 --> 04:05.778
I MISSED IT AGAIN.
我又错过了。

04:05.861 --> 04:08.155
THIS DARN CAMERA
ISN'T FAST ENOUGH.
这该死的相机
还不够快。

04:10.199 --> 04:11.826
HOLD ON A SECOND, PATRICK.
请稍等，帕特里克。

04:11.909 --> 04:14.578
IT'S NOT THE POOR CAMERA'S FAULT
YOU CAN'T GET A PHOTO.
这不是相机的问题
你拿不到照片。

04:14.662 --> 04:16.038
IT'S NOT?
它不是？

04:16.122 --> 04:19.041
NO, IT IS THE VERY NATURE
OF THE FRAGILE BUBBLE.
不，这就是自然
脆弱的泡沫。

04:19.125 --> 04:20.209
IT IS?
这是？

04:20.292 --> 04:21.627
YES, IT IS, MY FRIEND.
是的，是的，我的朋友。

04:21.711 --> 04:24.839
ALLOW ME TO DEMONSTRATE.
请允许我演示一下。

04:29.593 --> 04:32.054
♪ THE SUN MUST SET ♪
♪ 太阳必须落山 ♪

04:32.138 --> 04:35.057
♪ AT THE END OF EVERY DAY ♪
♪ 每天结束时 ♪

04:35.141 --> 04:38.436
♪ AND THE CURTAIN MUST FALL ♪
♪ 帷幕必须落下 ♪

04:38.519 --> 04:41.314
♪ AT THE END OF EVERY PLAY ♪
♪ 每场比赛结束 ♪

04:41.397 --> 04:45.776
♪ AND EVERY LITTLE BUBBLE
EVER BLOWN ♪
♪ 以及每一个小气泡
永远吹响♪

04:45.860 --> 04:50.656
♪ MUST SOMEDAY POP ♪
♪ 总有一天会流行 ♪

04:50.740 --> 04:54.535
♪ LIKE PRESENTS
ON CHRISTMAS DAY ♪
♪ 喜欢礼物
圣诞节那天♪

04:54.618 --> 04:57.580
♪ AND IT DOESN'T SEEM TO STAY ♪
♪ 它似乎不会留下来 ♪

04:57.663 --> 05:00.750
♪ OR A CHEESE SOUFFLE ♪
♪ 或者奶酪舒芙蕾 ♪

05:00.833 --> 05:03.836
♪ IT DOESN'T LAST ALL DAY ♪
♪ 它不会持续一整天 ♪

05:03.919 --> 05:07.173
♪ I WILL TRY ♪
♪ 我会尝试 ♪

05:07.256 --> 05:08.382
♪ AGAIN ♪
♪ 再次 ♪

05:08.466 --> 05:09.592
Chorus: ♪ TRY AGAIN ♪
合唱：♪ 再试一次 ♪

05:09.675 --> 05:10.926
♪ TO BLOW A BUBBLE ♪
♪ 吹泡泡 ♪

05:11.010 --> 05:12.845
Chorus: ♪ TO BLOW A BUBBLE ♪
合唱：♪ 吹泡泡 ♪

05:12.928 --> 05:17.683
♪ THAT WILL LAST ALL DAY ♪
♪ 这将持续一整天 ♪

05:17.767 --> 05:19.351
Chorus: ♪ TRY TO BLOW A BUBBLE ♪
合唱：♪ 尝试吹泡泡 ♪

05:19.435 --> 05:20.895
♪ THAT WILL LAST ♪
♪ 这会持续 ♪

05:20.978 --> 05:24.398
Man: ♪ ALL DAY ♪
男人：♪ 一整天 ♪

05:35.409 --> 05:36.535
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

05:36.619 --> 05:38.037
NOT NOW, PATRICK.
现在不行，帕特里克。

05:38.120 --> 05:40.498
THIS BUBBLE IS GONNA
BREAK ALL RECORDS.
这个泡沫即将来临
打破所有记录。

05:40.581 --> 05:44.418
WELL, I HOPE IT DOESN'T BREAK
UNTIL WE GET A LITTLE CLOSER
TO THE GROUND.
好吧，我希望它不会坏掉
直到我们再靠近一点
到地面。

05:44.502 --> 05:45.711
HUH?
嗯？

05:45.795 --> 05:48.839
WHAT HAVE I DONE?
我做了什么？

05:54.261 --> 05:56.680
WE'RE NEVER GONNA
GET OUT OF HERE.
我们永远不会
离开这里。

06:00.392 --> 06:02.144
WHAT HAPPENED?
发生了什么？

06:02.228 --> 06:03.729
THAT'S WHAT HAPPENED.
事情就是这样发生的。

06:03.813 --> 06:06.357
Patrick: WHOA, WHAT IS IT?
帕特里克：哇，这是什么？

06:06.440 --> 06:07.483
IT LOOKS REALLY OLD.
它看起来真的很旧。

06:07.566 --> 06:09.819
"ANTIS."
“安蒂斯。”

06:09.902 --> 06:11.112
WHAT DO YOU THINK
THAT MEANS, PATRICK?
你觉得怎么样
这意味着，帕特里克？

06:11.195 --> 06:15.366
"ANTIS, ANTIS, SQUAREPANTIS."
“安蒂斯，安蒂斯，方盘蒂斯。”

06:15.449 --> 06:18.619
PROBABLY BELONGED
TO YOUR ANCIENT ANCESTORS.
可能属于
致您的远古祖先。

06:18.702 --> 06:25.751
SPONGEBOB "SQUAREPANTIS,"
YOU MUST WEAR THE ANCIENT CREST
OF YOUR ANCESTORS
海绵宝宝“方块人”
你必须佩戴远古徽章
你的祖先

06:25.835 --> 06:28.587
FOR IT IS YOUR BIRTHRIGHT!
因为这是你与生俱来的权利！

06:28.671 --> 06:29.588
MY BIRTHRIGHT!
我与生俱来的权利！

06:32.174 --> 06:34.260
LET'S TAKE THIS TO
THE BIKINI BOTTOM MUSEUM.
让我们把这个带到
比基尼泳裤博物馆。

06:34.343 --> 06:36.762
THEY'LL KNOW WHAT IT IS.
他们会知道那是什么。

06:38.639 --> 06:42.560
UH, BEAUTIFUL DAY FOR STANDING
OUTSIDE A MUSEUM DOING NOTHING.
呃，美好的一天，适合站立
博物馆外无所事事。

06:42.643 --> 06:46.856
WHATEVER YOU SAY.
无论你说什么。

06:54.405 --> 06:55.489
HELLO THERE.
你好呀。

06:55.573 --> 06:56.699
WELCOME TO THE MUSEUM.
欢迎来到博物馆。

06:56.782 --> 06:58.200
THAT'LL BE $3.
那是 3 美元。

06:58.284 --> 07:00.411
BUT I THOUGHT
IT WAS FREE TUESDAY.
但我想
周二免费。

07:00.494 --> 07:01.579
OH, NO, NO, NO.
哦，不，不，不。

07:01.662 --> 07:03.289
TODAY'S MONDAY.
今天是星期一。

07:03.372 --> 07:05.791
OTHERWISE, I WOULDN'T BE WEARING
THIS "I HATE MONDAYS" SHIRT.
不然我就不会穿
这件“我讨厌星期一”衬衫。

07:05.875 --> 07:06.959
GOOD POINT.
好点。

07:07.042 --> 07:09.378
ENJOY THE ARTIFACTS.
享受文物。

07:09.461 --> 07:11.130
DON'T STAND
IN ONE PLACE TOO LONG.
不要站着
在一个地方太长。

07:11.213 --> 07:13.632
PEOPLE MIGHT MISTAKE
YOU FOR ONE.
人们可能会犯错
你为一。

07:14.758 --> 07:15.718
SPONGEBOB.
海绵宝宝。

07:19.763 --> 07:22.433
WHOO, THAT WAS A CLOSE ONE.
哇，那是一场很接近的比赛。

07:24.602 --> 07:30.316
NEPTUNE'S ASCENSION,
THE ONLY SURVIVING PAINTING FROM
THE GREAT LOST CITY OF ATLANTIS.
海王星的提升，
唯一幸存的画作
伟大的失落之城亚特兰蒂斯。

07:30.399 --> 07:33.485
THIS IS JUST WHAT
THE DOCTOR ORDERED, SQUIDDY.
这就是这样
医生命令，鱿鱼。

07:33.569 --> 07:36.780
SPENDING YOUR DAY STUDYING
THE ATLANTEAN MASTERS.
花一天的时间学习
亚特兰蒂斯大师。

07:36.864 --> 07:39.325
AND BEST OF ALL, NO SPONGE...
最重要的是，没有海绵......

07:40.993 --> 07:42.786
WOULD YOU WATCH WHERE YOU'RE...?
你会注意你在哪里吗？

07:42.870 --> 07:44.496
WHAT IS THAT?
那是什么？

07:44.580 --> 07:46.248
WHAT ARE YOU DOING WITH
THE AMULET OF ATLANTIS?
你在做什么
亚特兰蒂斯的护身符？

07:46.332 --> 07:47.416
WE WERE JUST...
我们只是...

07:47.499 --> 07:48.751
WERE YOU GOING TO STEAL IT?
你要偷它吗？

07:48.834 --> 07:50.294
NO, SQUIDWARD, WE'D NEVER...
不，章鱼哥，我们永远不会……

07:50.377 --> 07:53.839
THIS IS A NEW LOW,
EVEN FOR YOU TWO.
这是一个新低，
即使是你们两个。

07:53.923 --> 07:57.092
LUCKY FOR YOU, I WAS HERE TODAY.
你很幸运，我今天在这里。

07:57.176 --> 08:00.721
STEALING ARTIFACTS COULD LAND
YOU IN THE STONY LONES...
窃取文物可能会发生
你在石头孤独中......

08:03.349 --> 08:07.728
YOU BOOBS FOUND THE MISSING HALF
OF THE ATLANTEAN AMULET.
你们的胸部找到了缺失的一半
亚特兰蒂斯护身符。

08:07.811 --> 08:09.521
WHAT'S AN ATLANTEAN OMELET?
什么是亚特兰蒂斯煎蛋卷？

08:09.605 --> 08:10.856
AMULET, NOT OMELET.
护身符，不是煎蛋卷。

08:10.940 --> 08:12.983
IT'S THE KEY TO UNTOLD RICHES.
这是通往无尽财富的钥匙。

08:13.067 --> 08:14.610
DID SOMEONE SAY UNTOLD RICHES?
有人说财富不计其数吗？

08:14.693 --> 08:16.570
YES, EUGENE.
是的，尤金。

08:16.654 --> 08:20.407
THE STREETS ARE LINED WITH GOLD,
AND THE STREET LAMPS
ARE MADE OF DIAMONDS.
街道两旁都是金色的，
和路灯
由钻石制成。

08:20.491 --> 08:22.076
DIAMOND LIGHT BULBS?
钻石灯泡？

08:22.159 --> 08:25.537
I WONDER WHAT THEY MAKE
THE MONEY OUT OF.
我想知道他们做了什么
钱出来了。

08:25.621 --> 08:29.208
FOR REASONS UNKNOWN,
THIS GREAT CITY
DISAPPEARED ONE DAY
出于未知原因，
这座伟大的城市
一日失踪

08:29.291 --> 08:31.585
BUT NO RUINS WERE EVER FOUND.
但没有发现任何废墟。

08:31.669 --> 08:35.714
ALL THE INVENTIONS YOU TAKE
FOR GRANTED WERE GIVEN TO US
BY THE ATLANTEANS.
你的所有发明
当然是给我们的
亚特兰蒂斯人。

08:35.798 --> 08:40.386
THEIR ADVANCES IN ART,
FINANCIAL WEALTH, AND WEAPONRY
WERE EONS AHEAD OF THEIR TIME.
他们在艺术上的进步，
金融财富和武器
远远领先于他们的时代。

08:40.469 --> 08:42.721
WHY IS THIS BUBBLE
PAINTED ON THE MURAL?
为什么会出现泡沫
画在壁画上？

08:42.805 --> 08:44.181
THAT'S JUST
THE OLDEST LIVING BUBBLE.
就是这样
最古老的现存泡沫。

08:45.557 --> 08:50.229
THE OLDEST LIVING BUBBLE, ALIVE?
最古老的泡沫还活着吗？

08:50.312 --> 08:51.855
BEHOLD, PATRICK!
看哪，帕特里克！

08:51.939 --> 08:53.482
THE OLDEST LIVING BUBBLE.
最古老的现存泡沫。

08:53.566 --> 08:56.151
THIS IS THE MOST
BEAUTIFUL BUBBLE I'VE EVER SEEN.
这是最
我见过的美丽的泡泡。

08:56.235 --> 08:58.529
THAT'S JUST A PAINTING,
YOU QUARTER-WIT.
那只是一幅画，
你这个机智鬼。

08:58.612 --> 09:00.406
QUARTER-WIT, HAH.
四分之一机智，哈哈。

09:00.489 --> 09:03.409
THAT'S LESS THAN HALF.
这还不到一半。

09:03.492 --> 09:05.953
THE REAL BUBBLE
LIVES IN ATLANTIS.
真正的泡沫
住在亚特兰蒂斯。

09:06.036 --> 09:09.832
SOME DUMB OLD BUBBLE PALES
IN COMPARISON TO THE ART.
一些愚蠢的老泡沫苍白
与艺术相比。

09:09.915 --> 09:10.916
MONEY.
钱。

09:11.000 --> 09:12.084
AND SCIENCE.
和科学。

09:12.167 --> 09:13.544
DON'T FORGET SCIENCE.
不要忘记科学。

09:13.627 --> 09:15.421
WHAT'S ALL THE HUBBUB, BOYS?
孩子们，到底发生了什么？

09:15.504 --> 09:19.091
THESE TWO CHOWDER-BRAINS FOUND
THE MISSING HALF OF THE AMULET.
这两个杂烩脑菜被发现
护身符缺失的一半。

09:19.174 --> 09:21.719
THE AMULET OF ATLANTIS?
亚特兰蒂斯的护身符？

09:21.802 --> 09:27.766
LEGEND SAYS,
WHEN THE TWO HALVES ARE JOINED,
THE PATH TO ATLANTIS IS OPENED.
传说说，
当两半连接在一起时，
通往亚特兰蒂斯的道路已经开启。

09:27.850 --> 09:29.059
WHAT ARE YOU WAITING ON?
您还在等什么？

09:29.143 --> 09:31.061
LET'S HITCH THEM TWO DOGGIES UP.
让我们把两只小狗拴起来吧。

09:31.145 --> 09:33.731
GO ON, SQUIDWARD.
继续吧，章鱼哥。

09:33.814 --> 09:35.190
HURRY UP, SQUIDWARD.
快点，章鱼哥。

09:35.274 --> 09:39.320
THAT MONEY AIN'T GETTIN'
ANY YOUNGER.
钱没到手
任何年轻的。

09:50.497 --> 09:54.793
THE MAGICAL PATH TO ATLANTIS
IS A VAN?
通往亚特兰蒂斯的神奇之路
是货车吗？

09:54.877 --> 09:57.629
NICE HOT ROD FLAMES.
漂亮的热棒火焰。

09:57.713 --> 10:00.966
WHAT'S IT DOING?
它在做什么？

10:10.976 --> 10:13.479
WELL, POLLY-WOLLY-DING-DANG-DOO.
好吧，波利-沃利-丁-当-杜。

10:13.562 --> 10:15.022
WOULD YOU LOOK AT THAT?
你会看一下吗？

10:15.105 --> 10:17.900
TAKE A GANDER, Y'ALL.
大家看一下。

10:17.983 --> 10:19.443
FABULOUS DECOR.
精美的装饰。

10:19.526 --> 10:21.153
IT'S QUITE A VESSEL,
BUT WHO'S MANNING IT?
这是一个相当大的容器，
但谁在操纵它呢？

10:21.236 --> 10:24.031
Computer voice: GREETINGS.
电脑语音：您好。

10:24.114 --> 10:26.367
WELCOME ABOARD
THE SEA SHIP ATLANTIS.
欢迎加入
亚特兰蒂斯号海船。

10:26.450 --> 10:30.746
THIS IS A NONSTOP TRIP,
SO PLEASE, TAKE A SEAT, RELAX,
AND WE'LL BE ON OUR WAY.
这是一次不间断的旅行，
所以请坐下来放松一下
我们就上路了。

10:30.829 --> 10:32.039
GOOD.
好的。

10:32.122 --> 10:34.208
BET THERE'S SOME
LOOSE CHANGE IN HERE.
打赌有一些
这里有零钱。

10:34.291 --> 10:37.211
AH, SO THIS IS WHAT
LUXURY FEELS LIKE.
啊，原来如此
奢华的感觉。

10:38.462 --> 10:42.341
WHAT I WOULDN'T DO
FOR A FOOT RUB.
我不会做什么
用于足部按摩。

10:43.967 --> 10:45.677
Computer voice:
ATTENTION, PASSENGERS.
电脑语音：
乘客们请注意。

10:45.761 --> 10:47.971
REGRETFULLY, WE LACK THE FUEL
NEEDED FOR FORWARD MOTION.
遗憾的是，我们缺乏燃料
向前运动所需。

10:48.055 --> 10:49.431
All: WHAT?
所有人：什么？

10:57.106 --> 10:58.899
IS THIS SOME KIND OF JOKE?
这是什么玩笑吗？

10:58.982 --> 11:01.026
WHERE'S THE GAS TANK?
煤气罐在哪里？

11:01.110 --> 11:04.863
Computer: WE ATLANTEANS FIND
THE USE OF FOSSIL FUELS
TO BE COUNTER-INTUITIVE
计算机：我们大西洋人发现
化石燃料的使用
违反直觉

11:04.947 --> 11:08.409
AND HAVE DEVELOPED
AN ALTERNATIVE SOURCE
WE CALL SONG.
并已开发
另一种来源
我们称之为宋。

11:08.492 --> 11:09.910
HUH?
嗯？

11:09.993 --> 11:13.205
Computer: THE ENGINE OF
THIS VESSEL IS FUELED BY SONG.
计算机：引擎
这艘船以歌曲为动力。

11:13.288 --> 11:17.709
THE MORE YOU SING
OF YOUR DESIRES, THE CLOSER
TO ATLANTIS YOU WILL GET.
你唱得越多
更接近您的愿望
您将到达亚特兰蒂斯。

11:17.793 --> 11:18.919
LET US COMMENCE SINGING.
让我们开始唱歌吧。

11:19.002 --> 11:20.379
DOES THAT MAKE ANY SENSE?
这有什么意义吗？

11:20.462 --> 11:23.340
NO, BUT I'M GAME
FOR SINGING ANY DAY.
不，但我愿意
适合任何一天唱歌。

11:23.424 --> 11:25.551
♪ SING ♪
♪ 唱歌 ♪

11:25.634 --> 11:27.094
♪ SING A SONG ♪
♪ 唱首歌 ♪

11:27.177 --> 11:29.221
♪ A SONG OF WANTING
TO MOVE ALONG ♪
♪ 一首渴望之歌
一起前进♪

11:29.304 --> 11:32.474
♪ TO A LAND
WHERE ALL OUR DREAMS ♪
♪ 到一片土地
我们所有的梦想都在哪里♪

11:32.558 --> 11:33.725
WHOOPS, SORRY.
哎呀，抱歉。

11:33.809 --> 11:36.895
♪ TO A LAND
WHERE ALL OUR DREAMS ♪
♪ 到一片土地
我们所有的梦想都在哪里♪

11:36.979 --> 11:40.983
♪ CAN FINALLY COME TRUE ♪
♪ 终于可以实现 ♪

11:41.066 --> 11:42.359
♪ A BUBBLE I LONG FOR ♪
♪ 我渴望的泡沫 ♪

11:42.443 --> 11:44.069
♪ IT SO ELUDES ME ♪
♪ 我实在无法理解 ♪

11:44.153 --> 11:46.071
♪ BUT SOON ENOUGH, I WILL SEE ♪
♪ 但很快我就会看到 ♪

11:46.155 --> 11:47.406
♪ WELL, THAT'S JUST
SPLENDID, BOY ♪
♪ 嗯，就是这样
太棒了，男孩♪

11:47.489 --> 11:48.907
♪ AND THEN, WE'RE IN BIG MONEY ♪
♪ 然后，我们就赚大钱了 ♪

11:48.991 --> 11:50.200
♪ MORE THAN YOU CAN SPEND ♪
♪ 超出您的消费能力 ♪

11:50.284 --> 11:51.743
♪ WITH FIVES AND 10s AND 50s ♪
♪ 5 岁、10 岁和 50 岁 ♪

11:51.827 --> 11:53.287
♪ AND I'LL WANT
TO BE YOUR FRIEND ♪
♪ 我想要
成为你的朋友♪

11:53.370 --> 11:54.788
Plankton:
浮游生物：

11:54.872 --> 11:56.999
♪ SUCH A VALIANT DESIRE ♪
♪ 多么勇敢的愿望 ♪

11:58.417 --> 12:00.169
♪ THE LOST WEAPONS OF ATLANTIS ♪
♪ 亚特兰蒂斯失落的武器 ♪

12:00.252 --> 12:02.087
♪ THE MOST ADVANCED
OF ALL TIME ♪
♪ 最先进
有史以来的 ♪

12:02.171 --> 12:03.881
♪ AS SOON AS THIS
DOPEY SONG IS DONE ♪
♪ 尽快
呆萌的歌已经完成了♪

12:03.964 --> 12:05.591
♪ I PLAN TO MAKE THEM MINE ♪
♪ 我打算把它们变成我的 ♪

12:05.674 --> 12:07.468
Sandy: ♪ DID YOU ALL
HEAR SOMETHING? ♪
桑迪：♪你们都是吗？
听到什么了吗？ ♪

12:07.551 --> 12:10.846
♪ I CAN HARDLY BELIEVE
THAT THERE'S A LOST CITY ♪
♪ 我简直不敢相信
那是一座失落的城市♪

12:10.929 --> 12:15.350
♪ WHERE HAVING SMARTS
IS MORE IMPORTANT
THAN BEING PRETTY ♪
♪ 哪里有智慧
更重要
比漂亮更重要♪

12:15.434 --> 12:17.478
♪ WITH ALL THEIR
ADVANCED SCIENCE ♪
♪ 与他们所有
先进的科学♪

12:17.561 --> 12:19.480
♪ AND MY PAINFULLY
ENLARGED MIND ♪
♪ 还有我的痛苦
心胸开阔♪

12:19.563 --> 12:22.274
♪ I BET WE CAN FIGURE OUT HOW
TO MAKE WONDROUS THINGS ♪
♪ 我打赌我们能想出办法
创造奇妙的事物 ♪

12:22.357 --> 12:25.861
♪ LIKE MELONS
WITH EDIBLE RINDS ♪
♪ 像瓜一样
带可食用外皮 ♪

12:25.944 --> 12:28.697
♪ AS A CONNOISSEUR OF FINE ART ♪
♪ 作为美术鉴赏家 ♪

12:28.780 --> 12:30.407
♪ I'M PROUD TO SAY ♪
♪ 我很自豪地说 ♪

12:30.491 --> 12:32.618
♪ I'VE ALWAYS SEEN THINGS
IN MY OWN SPECIAL WAY ♪
♪ 我总是看到一些东西
以我自己的特殊方式♪

12:32.701 --> 12:35.746
♪ "ARTLANTIS," WITH
THEIR GLORIOUS AESTHETICS ♪
♪ “ARTLANTIS”，与
他们华丽的美学♪

12:35.829 --> 12:38.457
♪ I'LL COP THEIR STYLE,
AND IN A WHILE ♪
♪ 我会模仿他们的风格，
过了一会儿 ♪

12:38.540 --> 12:41.793
♪ MY ART WILL BE PROPHETIC ♪
♪ 我的艺术将具有预言性 ♪

12:41.877 --> 12:42.920
♪ I'M PATRICK ♪
♪ 我是帕特里克 ♪

12:43.003 --> 12:44.254
♪ I'M PATRICK ♪
♪ 我是帕特里克 ♪

12:44.338 --> 12:45.797
♪ PATRICK, PATRICK, PATRICK ♪
♪ 帕特里克，帕特里克，帕特里克 ♪

12:45.881 --> 12:49.051
♪ AND I LIKE... ♪
♪ 我喜欢... ♪

12:49.134 --> 12:53.889
UH, I DON'T KNOW WHAT I LIKE.
呃，我不知道我喜欢什么。

12:53.972 --> 12:56.642
Computer voice: WARNING:
YOU HAVE RUN OUT OF SONG FUEL.
计算机语音： 警告：
你的歌曲燃料已经用完了。

12:59.019 --> 13:01.021
HEY, LOOK, IT'S ATLANTIS.
嘿，看，这是亚特兰蒂斯。

13:01.104 --> 13:02.189
SpongeBob: PRETTY.
海绵宝宝：漂亮。

13:11.406 --> 13:13.909
YOU DIMWITS HAVEN'T EVEN
BEEN HERE TWO MINUTES
你们这些傻瓜还没有
在这里呆了两分钟

13:13.992 --> 13:17.621
AND YOU'VE ALREADY MESSED UP
SOMEONE'S TOPIARY GARDEN.
而你已经搞砸了
有人的修剪花园。

13:22.167 --> 13:23.544
GO ON, SPONGEBOB.
继续吧，海绵宝宝。

13:23.627 --> 13:24.753
RING THE BELL.
按响门铃。

13:24.836 --> 13:27.047
RING FOR THE KING, HUH?
为国王指环，嗯？

13:39.268 --> 13:42.020
WELCOME TO ATLANTIS.
欢迎来到亚特兰蒂斯。

13:42.104 --> 13:44.189
I'VE BEEN EXPECTING YOU.
我一直在等你。

13:50.279 --> 13:52.489
ALLOW ME TO INTRODUCE MYSELF.
请允许我自我介绍一下。

13:52.573 --> 13:58.036
I AM THE LORD ROYAL HIGHNESS,
BUT MY FRIENDS CALL ME L.R.H.
我是陛下，
但我的朋友们都叫我 L.R.H.

13:58.120 --> 13:59.871
MY FRIENDS CALL ME SPONGEBOB.
我的朋友们叫我海绵宝宝。

13:59.955 --> 14:01.957
I'M HERE TO SEE
THE OLDEST BUBBLE.
我来这里看看
最古老的泡沫。

14:02.040 --> 14:03.458
YES, OF COURSE.
是的当然。

14:03.542 --> 14:04.876
Krabs: WHAT A RIP OFF.
螃蟹：真是骗人的。

14:04.960 --> 14:06.587
THIS STREET AIN'T GOLD.
这条街不是黄金街。

14:06.670 --> 14:10.215
OH, IF IT'S GOLD YOU WANT,
YOU'LL FIND IT IN OUR VAULT.
哦，如果你想要黄金，
您会在我们的金库中找到它。

14:10.299 --> 14:11.258
I'M EUGENE.
我是尤金。

14:11.341 --> 14:12.384
I LIKE MONEY.
我喜欢钱。

14:12.467 --> 14:13.719
I CAN SEE THAT.
我可以看到这一点。

14:13.802 --> 14:15.429
PLEASURE TO MEET YOU.
很高兴见到您。

14:15.512 --> 14:18.849
COME, I'LL GIVE YOU
THE GRAND TOUR
OF OUR ATLANTEAN FORTRESS.
来吧，我给你
盛大旅行
我们的亚特兰蒂斯要塞。

14:18.932 --> 14:24.021
I'M SO GLAD YOU'RE ALL HERE.
我很高兴你们都在这里。

14:24.104 --> 14:25.272
THEY'RE GONE.
他们走了。

14:25.355 --> 14:28.275
NOW TO GET TO THOSE WEAPONS.
现在来看看这些武器。

14:30.027 --> 14:31.403
TRAPPED!
被困了！

14:31.486 --> 14:34.031
OK, WHAT DO I HAVE
TO WORK WITH HERE?
好的，我有什么
在这里工作？

14:34.114 --> 14:35.115
WHAT'S THIS?
这是什么？

14:35.198 --> 14:37.576
OWNERS MANUAL?
用户手册？

14:37.659 --> 14:40.579
LOOKS LIKE I'VE FOUND
MY ESCAPE ROUTE.
看起来我已经找到了
我的逃生路线。

14:45.083 --> 14:46.918
OW.
哦。

14:47.002 --> 14:50.380
Lord Royal Highness: FOR
CENTURIES, WE ATLANTEANS SPENT
殿下：为了
我们亚特兰蒂斯人度过了几个世纪

14:50.464 --> 14:53.175
NAY, WASTED OUR TALENTS
AND ENERGY
不，浪费了我们的才能
和能源

14:53.258 --> 14:59.264
BUILDING THE MOST
SOPHISTICATED WEAPONRY TO
DEFEND OURSELVES FROM INVADERS
建造最多
先进的武器
保卫我们自己免受入侵者的侵害

14:59.348 --> 15:02.267
BUT WE ABANDONED THE IDEA
OF WARFARE LONG AGO
但我们放弃了这个想法
很久以前的战争

15:02.351 --> 15:07.939
AND NOW, ALL THESE WEAPONS
GATHER DUST BEHIND
THIS LOCKED DOOR AS AN EXAMPLE
现在，所有这些武器
收集后面的灰尘
以这扇锁着的门为例

15:08.023 --> 15:11.943
OF WHAT MUST BE DONE
IF ONE WISHES TO LIVE IN HARMONY
必须做什么
如果一个人希望和谐相处

15:12.027 --> 15:15.906
WITH ALL CREATURES
OF THIS OR ANY WORLD.
与所有生物
这个世界或任何世界的。

15:15.989 --> 15:17.449
Krabs:  ,
HARMONY, "SHMARMONY."
螃蟹：，
和谐，“和谐”。

15:17.532 --> 15:19.076
WHEN DO WE GET
TO SEE THE TREASURE?
我们什么时候得到
去看宝藏？

15:19.159 --> 15:20.619
BUT OF COURSE.
当然。

15:20.702 --> 15:21.453
FOLLOW ME.
跟我来。

15:21.536 --> 15:24.164
COMING THROUGH, BOYS.
挺过来了，孩子们。

15:24.247 --> 15:30.087
THESE ATLANTEANS LEAVE
A ROOM FULL OF THE MOST
ADVANCED WEAPONRY UNGUARDED?
这些亚特兰蒂斯人离开了
一个充满最多的房间
先进武器无人防守？

15:30.170 --> 15:33.965
NO WONDER THEY GOT LOST.
难怪他们迷路了。

15:35.384 --> 15:36.927
OH, MY.
哦，我的。

15:37.010 --> 15:41.973
THERE WILL BE NO ONE
TO STOP ME THIS TIME.
不会有人
这次来阻止我。

16:00.742 --> 16:03.078
WELL, BAD NEWS, KIDS.
好吧，坏消息，孩子们。

16:03.161 --> 16:05.122
ENCINO'S STILL LOST.
恩西诺仍然迷失方向。

16:06.748 --> 16:10.127
OOH, BUT AT LEAST
I GOT ME RADIO FIXED.
哦，但至少
我修好了收音机。

16:16.049 --> 16:20.846
WELL, ENJOY
THE REST OF THE SHOW.
好吧，享受吧
演出的其余部分。

16:20.929 --> 16:25.642
Lord Royal Highness: IT IS BOTH
AN HONOR AND A PLEASURE
TO WELCOME YOU TO ATLANTIS.
殿下：两者皆是
一种荣誉和乐趣
欢迎您来到亚特兰蒂斯。

16:25.726 --> 16:28.645
WE HAVEN'T HAD VISITORS
IN QUITE SOME TIME.
我们还没有访客
在相当长的一段时间内。

16:28.729 --> 16:31.523
YOU SEE, BEING A LOST CITY
HAS CERTAIN DISADVANTAGES.
你看，这是一座失落的城市
有一定的缺点。

16:31.606 --> 16:33.692
BUT I DIGRESS.
但我离题了。

16:33.775 --> 16:38.989
NOW, IF YOU WILL JUST FOLLOW ME,
I'LL SHOW YOU SOME
OF OUR GRANDEST ACHIEVEMENTS.
现在，如果你愿意跟着我，
我给你看一些
我们最伟大的成就。

16:39.072 --> 16:41.825
SQUIDWARD, YOU TOLD ME
THE STREETS WERE PAVED
WITH GOLD.
章鱼哥，你告诉我的
街道已铺好
与黄金。

16:41.908 --> 16:47.456
NOW, THAT STREET LIGHT BETTER BE
A 600 CARAT DIAMOND, OR ELSE.
现在，街灯最好是
600 克拉钻石，或其他。

16:48.790 --> 16:50.208
OH, HOLD STILL, SQUIDWARD.
噢，别动，章鱼哥。

16:50.292 --> 16:52.753
YOU'RE STANDING ON MY NECK.
你站在我的脖子上。

16:52.836 --> 16:54.504
OOH, WHAT?
哦，什么？

16:55.714 --> 16:57.048
ARE YOU ALL RIGHT?
你还好吗？

16:57.132 --> 16:59.760
YEAH, BUT I FEEL ODD.
是的，但我感觉很奇怪。

17:03.597 --> 17:04.806
MR. KRABS, ARE YOU OK?
先生。蟹蟹，你还好吗？

17:04.890 --> 17:08.477
I'D KNOW THAT SMELL ANYWHERE.
我知道到处都有这种气味。

17:09.644 --> 17:10.979
ME POCKETS!
我的口袋！

17:11.062 --> 17:12.439
THEY BE SMELLIN' LOOT.
他们闻到了战利品的味道。

17:16.818 --> 17:18.195
HEY.
嘿。

17:18.278 --> 17:21.782
THOSE POCKETS OF YOURS REALLY
HAVE A NOSE FOR TREASURE.
你的口袋真的
对宝藏有敏锐的嗅觉。

17:21.865 --> 17:23.867
THESE ARE ME
HOUND'S-TOOTH PANTS.
这些就是我
千鸟格裤。

17:23.950 --> 17:27.078
WHAT YOU SEE HERE IS A GLIMPSE
OF ANCIENT ATLANTEAN HISTORY.
您在这里看到的只是一瞥
古代亚特兰蒂斯的历史。

17:27.162 --> 17:30.540
LONG AGO, WE ABANDONED
OUR OBSESSION WITH WEALTH
很久以前，我们就放弃了
我们对财富的痴迷

17:30.624 --> 17:33.084
TO FOCUS ON
THE PURSUIT OF KNOWLEDGE
专注于
对知识的追求

17:33.168 --> 17:36.338
SO HELP YOURSELF TO AS MUCH
AS YOUR POCKETS CAN CARRY.
所以尽量帮助自己
您的口袋可以携带。

17:36.421 --> 17:38.590
AS MUCH AS ME POCKETS CAN CARRY?
我的口袋能装多少东西？

17:38.673 --> 17:40.217
♪ OH... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

17:40.300 --> 17:43.094
♪ IF I'D ONLY KNOWN
WHEN I WOKE UP TODAY ♪
♪ 如果我知道就好了
当我今天醒来时♪

17:43.178 --> 17:46.807
♪ I'D HAVE STOPPED
AT ME TAILOR'S ALONG THE WAY ♪
♪ 我已经停下来了
裁缝一直在我身边 ♪

17:46.890 --> 17:49.726
♪ AND HAD 10 MORE POCKETS
PUT ON ME PANTS ♪
♪ 还有 10 个口袋
穿上裤子♪

17:49.810 --> 17:52.312
♪ 'CAUSE I THINK I HEAR
A MONEY AVALANCHE ♪
♪ 因为我想我听到了
金钱雪崩♪

17:53.814 --> 17:55.357
♪ LOOK AT ALL THIS CASH, HEY ♪
♪ 看看这些现金，嘿 ♪

17:55.440 --> 17:56.733
♪ LOOK AT ALL THIS MONEY ♪
♪ 看看这些钱 ♪

17:56.817 --> 17:58.443
♪ I HOPE ME HEART CAN TAKE IT ♪
♪ 我希望我的心能承受 ♪

18:00.570 --> 18:01.488
CLEAR.
清除。

18:01.571 --> 18:03.114
I'M ALL RIGHT, SONNY.
我没事，索尼。

18:03.198 --> 18:06.034
♪ INDUSTRIAL ACCIDENTS
CAN MAKE QUITE A MESS ♪
♪ 工伤事故
可能会弄得一团糟 ♪

18:06.118 --> 18:09.079
♪ UNLESS YOU FALL
INTO A MONEY PRESS ♪
♪ 除非你跌倒
进入压钞机 ♪

18:09.162 --> 18:12.624
♪ OH, MAKE ME INTO MONEY,
MR. WONDERFUL MACHINE ♪
♪ 哦，让我变成金钱，
先生。很棒的机器 ♪

18:12.707 --> 18:17.170
♪ I ALWAYS KNEW THAT
ME TRUE COLOR WAS GREEN ♪
♪ 我一直都知道
我真正的颜色是绿色 ♪

18:17.254 --> 18:20.632
♪ OH, EVER SINCE
I WAS A LITTLE KID ♪
♪ 哦，从那时起
我还是个小孩子 ♪

18:20.715 --> 18:22.592
♪ I DREAMED OF SUCH A PLACE ♪
♪ 我梦想有一个这样的地方 ♪

18:22.676 --> 18:24.636
♪ YES, I DID ♪
♪ 是的，我做到了 ♪

18:24.719 --> 18:27.764
♪ WITH MOUNTAINS OF MONEY
AND RIVERS OF CASH ♪
♪ 金钱如山
还有源源不断的现金♪

18:27.848 --> 18:30.851
♪ AND A POOL OF COINS
TO MAKE A SPLASH ♪
♪ 还有一池硬币
引起轰动♪

18:30.934 --> 18:34.521
♪ OH, I'LL OPEN UP A KRUSTY KRAB
WITH PATTIES MADE OF MONEY ♪
♪ 哦，我要打开一只脆皮蟹
配上用钱做的馅饼 ♪

18:34.604 --> 18:38.525
♪ THEY'D BE DELICIOUS,
AND EXPENSIVE,
AND TASTE LIKE GOLDEN HONEY ♪
♪ 它们会很美味，
而且价格昂贵，
尝起来像金蜂蜜 ♪

18:38.608 --> 18:43.488
♪ MONEY AND GOLD
AND TREASURE UNTOLD ♪
♪ 金钱和黄金
还有无法描述的宝藏 ♪

18:43.572 --> 18:45.657
♪ AND ALL OF IT FOR ME. ♪
♪ 这一切都是为了我。 ♪

18:45.740 --> 18:47.450
Lord Royal Highness: MR. KRABS.
殿下：先生。螃蟹。

18:47.534 --> 18:48.869
WE'RE OFF TO SEE THE BUBBLE.
我们要去看看泡沫了。

18:48.952 --> 18:50.954
WOULD YOU CARE TO JOIN US?
您愿意加入我们吗？

18:51.037 --> 18:52.080
ARE YOU KIDDING?
你在开玩笑吧？

18:52.163 --> 18:54.791
I JUST GOT HERE!
我刚到这里！

18:54.875 --> 18:56.001
Lord Royal Highness:
VERY WELL, THEN.
殿下：
那么，很好。

18:56.084 --> 18:57.627
OFF WE GO.
我们出发吧。

18:57.711 --> 18:59.963
SPONGEBOB, WHEN ARE WE
GONNA SEE THE BUBBLE?
海绵宝宝，我们什么时候
会看到泡沫吗？

19:00.046 --> 19:01.089
PATRICK, SHH.
帕特里克，嘘。

19:01.172 --> 19:02.632
DON'T DALLY, LADS.
别磨磨蹭蹭，小伙子们。

19:02.716 --> 19:04.342
YOU DON'T WANT TO BE
LEFT BEHIND, DO YOU?
你不想成为
你落后了吗？

19:04.426 --> 19:05.594
NO, SIR.
不，先生。

19:05.677 --> 19:08.763
COME ON ALONG, PATRICK.
来吧，帕特里克。

19:08.847 --> 19:13.768
YOU KNOW, L.R.H.,
I WAS BORN WITH
A HEALTHY SCIENTIFIC CURIOSITY
你知道，L.R.H.，
我生来就有
健康的科学好奇心

19:13.852 --> 19:17.689
AND I WAS WONDERING
IF I COULD GET A PEEK AT SOME OF
YOUR SCIENTIFIC ACHIEVEMENTS.
我想知道
如果我能看到一些
您的科学成就。

19:17.772 --> 19:19.441
OF COURSE, MS. CHEEKS.
当然，女士。脸颊。

19:19.524 --> 19:24.196
HERE WE ARE, THE CULMINATION
OF ALL OUR TECHNOLOGY.
我们在这里，高潮
我们所有的技术。

19:24.279 --> 19:30.118
I GIVE YOU THE ATLANTEAN HALL
OF SCIENCE.
我给你亚特兰蒂斯大厅
科学的。

19:32.162 --> 19:33.788
HOPPIN' ACORNS!
跳橡子！

19:33.872 --> 19:36.625
LOOK AT ALL THIS HIGH-TECH GEAR!
看看这些高科技装备！

19:36.708 --> 19:38.543
WHAT DOES THIS GIZMO DO?
这个小发明有什么作用？

19:38.627 --> 19:40.879
IT'S A BIO-MASS
CONVERTING DEVICE.
这是一种生物质
转换装置。

19:40.962 --> 19:43.423
IT CAN TAKE
ANY HOUSEHOLD OBJECT
它可以采取
任何家居物品

19:43.506 --> 19:48.720
THIS COMB, FOR EXAMPLE,
AND TURN IT INTO,
SAY, ICE CREAM.
例如，这个梳子，
并将其变成，
说，冰淇淋。

19:50.680 --> 19:51.806
WOULD ANYONE LIKE TO TRY?
有人想尝试吗？

19:51.890 --> 19:54.684
Both: ME, ME, ME, ME, ME!
两人：我，我，我，我，我！

19:54.768 --> 19:56.102
GO AHEAD.
前进。

19:56.186 --> 19:57.354
YAY!
耶！

20:01.858 --> 20:03.735
COMB FLAVORED.
梳子味。

20:03.818 --> 20:05.445
WHAT ELSE CAN IT
TURN THINGS INTO?
还能做什么
把事情变成？

20:05.528 --> 20:08.698
ACTUALLY, IT CAN ONLY
TURN THINGS INTO ICE CREAM.
实际上，它只能
把东西变成冰淇淋。

20:08.782 --> 20:11.076
WE HAVEN'T WORKED
THAT BUG OUT YET.
我们还没工作
那个错误还没有出现。

20:11.159 --> 20:17.916
BUT I CAN SHOW YOU THE MOST
AMAZING-SLASH-FANTASTIC DEVICE
CREATED BY ATLANTEAN HANDS.
但我可以向你展示最多的
令人惊叹的精彩设备
由亚特兰蒂斯之手创建。

20:17.999 --> 20:23.713
BEHOLD, THIS GRAND MACHINE
ALLOWS THE USER TO BE
BROKEN DOWN TO NANO-STATURE
看哪，这台伟大的机器
允许用户
分解至纳米级

20:23.797 --> 20:27.384
ENABLING THEM TO BATTLE GERMS
HAND TO HAND.
使他们能够对抗细菌
手拉手。

20:27.467 --> 20:28.760
HOW'S IT WORK?
怎么样？

20:28.843 --> 20:30.887
PLEASE HAVE A SEAT,
AND I'LL EXPLAIN.
请坐，
我会解释一下。

20:30.971 --> 20:32.472
NOW, HERE'S HOW IT WORKS.
现在，它是如何工作的。

20:32.555 --> 20:35.934
HEY, COOL.
嘿，酷。

20:36.017 --> 20:38.395
WHERE'D SPONGEBOB GO?
海绵宝宝去哪儿了？

20:38.478 --> 20:41.856
RIGHT NOW, HIS MOLECULES
ARE BEING BROKEN DOWN
INTO DATA
现在，他的分子
正在崩溃
进入数据

20:41.940 --> 20:46.528
WHICH IS ASSEMBLED
INTO THIS COMPUTER,
AND IS STORED ON THESE TAPES.
已组装完毕
进入这台计算机，
并存储在这些磁带上。

20:46.611 --> 20:48.780
THEN, REASSEMBLED ON
A MUCH SMALLER SCALE.
然后，重新组装
规模小得多。

20:48.863 --> 20:50.448
SOMEONE, HELP ME!
谁来帮帮我吧！

20:50.532 --> 20:54.077
AND FINALLY PASSES THROUGH
THIS TUBE AND INTO THIS TANK
最终通过
这个管子和这个水箱

20:54.160 --> 20:56.454
WHICH CONTAINS
EVERY ELEMENT KNOWN TO...
其中包含
每个已知的元素...

20:56.538 --> 20:59.332
OH, DEAR HEAVENS,
IT LOOKS LIKE OUR SCIENTISTS
哦，亲爱的天堂，
它看起来像我们的科学家

20:59.416 --> 21:02.502
WERE WORKING ON
A VERY AGGRESSIVE CASE
OF THE SNIFFLES.
正在研究
一个非常激进的案例
鼻涕的。

21:02.585 --> 21:04.379
HE COULD BE IN TROUBLE.
他可能会遇到麻烦。

21:04.462 --> 21:05.630
DON'T WORRY, SPONGEBOB.
别担心，海绵宝宝。

21:05.714 --> 21:08.466
I'M COMING TO HELP YOU.
我来帮助你。

21:08.550 --> 21:09.676
OK, I'VE SEEN ENOUGH.
好吧，我已经看够了。

21:09.759 --> 21:12.470
LET ME OUT OF THIS THING!
让我离开这件事！

21:18.727 --> 21:23.356
WHAT'S GOING ON HERE?
这是怎么回事？

21:23.440 --> 21:25.316
OH, NO.
哦，不。

21:28.278 --> 21:31.239
SQUIDWARD, DON'T MAKE
ANY SUDDEN MOVEMENTS.
章鱼哥，别做
任何突然的动作。

21:40.081 --> 21:41.082
HELP!
帮助！

21:44.586 --> 21:47.005
All: HELP, SANDY!
全体：救命，桑迪！

21:47.088 --> 21:49.466
SOUNDS LIKE THEM CRITTERS
IS IN TROUBLE.
听起来像小动物
有麻烦了。

21:54.888 --> 21:56.681
HOLD ON, FELLOWS!
坚持住，伙计们！

21:56.765 --> 22:00.769
I'LL BE THERE SOON,
AS SOON AS I SEND THESE CRITTERS
TO THEIR DOOM.
我很快就会到那里，
我一送出这些小动物
他们的灭亡。

22:04.647 --> 22:06.024
♪ LOOK OUT, GERMS ♪
♪ 小心，细菌 ♪

22:06.107 --> 22:07.901
♪ THE END IS NEAR ♪
♪ 末日已近 ♪

22:07.984 --> 22:09.611
♪ YOUR DAYS ARE NUMBERED ♪
♪ 你的日子屈指可数了 ♪

22:09.694 --> 22:11.529
♪ 'CAUSE SANDY'S HERE ♪
♪ 因为桑迪在这里 ♪

22:11.613 --> 22:13.281
♪ I'LL GET THESE GERMS ♪
♪ 我会感染这些细菌 ♪

22:13.364 --> 22:15.116
♪ AND MAKE 'EM PAY ♪
♪ 让他们付出代价 ♪

22:15.200 --> 22:17.452
♪ WITH SOME GOOD
OLD-FASHIONED KARATE ♪
♪ 有一些好处
老式空手道 ♪

22:17.535 --> 22:19.079
♪ HI-YA! ♪
♪ 你好！ ♪

22:19.162 --> 22:22.457
♪ IF I BORROW SOME ELEMENTS
FROM THE PERIODIC TABLE ♪
♪ 如果我借用一些元素
来自元素周期表 ♪

22:22.540 --> 22:25.627
♪ I CAN MIX UP A BREW
THAT IS SURE TO DISABLE ♪
♪ 我可以调制一杯啤酒
这肯定会被禁用♪

22:25.710 --> 22:29.464
♪ ANY VIRUS, BUG, OR SNIFFLE
THAT STEPS INTO MY PATH ♪
♪ 任何病毒、错误或嗅探
这踏入了我的道路♪

22:29.547 --> 22:34.636
♪ AND MAKE THEM FEEL
MY MICROSCOPIC WRATH ♪
♪ 让他们感觉到
我的微观愤怒♪

22:34.719 --> 22:38.973
♪ HI-YA! ♪
♪ 你好！ ♪

22:39.057 --> 22:43.728
WELL, SHALL WE CONTINUE ON
WITH THE REST OF THE TOUR?
好吧，我们继续吧
与巡演的其余部分？

22:43.812 --> 22:46.314
Y'ALL HEAD OUT WITHOUT ME.
你们都离开我吧。

22:46.398 --> 22:47.607
WELL, THEN, GOOD LUCK.
那么，祝你好运。

22:47.690 --> 22:48.858
HAVE FUN.
玩得开心。

22:48.942 --> 22:50.527
WE'LL SEE YOU AT DINNER.
我们晚餐时见。

22:50.610 --> 22:54.280
YOUR FRIEND SANDY CERTAINLY
IS AN EXCITABLE ONE.
当然是你的朋友桑迪
是一个令人兴奋的人。

22:54.364 --> 22:55.865
QUITE.
相当。

22:55.949 --> 22:58.910
SOMEHOW, I KNEW I'D GET STUCK
WITH YOU YAHOOS THE LONGEST.
不知何故，我知道我会陷入困境
与您雅虎相处时间最长。

23:01.204 --> 23:03.039
♪ OH, WHAT A BEAUTIFUL SIGHT ♪
♪ 哦，多么美丽的景色 ♪

23:03.123 --> 23:05.583
♪ WEAPONS AS FAR AS
THE EYE CAN SEE ♪
♪ 尽可能多的武器
肉眼可见♪

23:05.667 --> 23:07.710
♪ BUT WHICH ONE
WILL BE RIGHT FOR ME? ♪
♪ 但哪一个
适合我吗？ ♪

23:07.794 --> 23:08.962
♪ HOW DO I PICK? ♪
♪ 我该如何选择？ ♪

23:09.045 --> 23:11.464
♪ WHICH ONE WILL DO THE TRICK? ♪
♪ 哪一个能解决这个问题？ ♪

23:11.548 --> 23:16.427
♪ WHICH IS BEST
TO GUARANTEE ETERNAL REST? ♪
♪ 哪一个最好
保证永恒的安息？ ♪

23:16.511 --> 23:19.222
♪ SO MANY WEAPONS,
HOW DO I CHOOSE? ♪
♪ 这么多武器，
我该如何选择？ ♪

23:19.305 --> 23:21.099
♪ LOOK AT THIS ONE,
WHAT A BEAUTIFUL FUSE ♪
♪ 看看这个，
多么漂亮的保险丝啊♪

23:21.182 --> 23:23.601
♪ AND WITH THIS ONE,
I COULDN'T LOSE ♪
♪ 有了这个，
我不能输♪

23:23.685 --> 23:27.522
♪ THAT ONE WOULD SURELY
GIVE THEM THE BLUES ♪
♪ 那肯定会
给他们忧郁的感觉 ♪

23:27.605 --> 23:30.859
♪ AND THIS ONE HERE
MATCHES MY SHOES ♪
♪ 还有这个
很配我的鞋子 ♪

23:30.942 --> 23:33.194
♪ COME ON, PLANKTON,
JUST PICK ONE ♪
♪ 来吧，浮游生物，
就选一个吧♪

23:33.278 --> 23:35.071
♪ AND FORGET ABOUT YOUR SHOES ♪
♪ 忘记你的鞋子 ♪

23:35.155 --> 23:36.781
♪ EENY, MEENY, MINY, MOE ♪
♪ 伊尼，米尼，米尼，萌 ♪

23:36.865 --> 23:40.201
♪ I PICK YOU, NOW LET'S GO ♪
♪ 我选你了，现在我们走吧 ♪

23:42.203 --> 23:47.834
THIS STUFF IS WONDERFUL AND ALL,
BUT WHEN ARE WE GONNA SEE
SOME REAL ATLANTEAN CULTURE?
这东西太棒了，
但我们什么时候才能看到
一些真正的亚特兰蒂斯文化？

23:47.917 --> 23:50.795
GENTLEMEN, WHAT IS ART?
先生们，什么是艺术？

23:50.879 --> 23:52.797
OH, OH, I KNOW, I KNOW!
哦，哦，我知道，我知道！

23:52.881 --> 23:55.091
I THOUGHT YOU'D NEVER ASK.
我以为你永远不会问。

23:55.175 --> 23:59.804
ART IS THE CONSCIOUS ARRANGEMENT
OF ELEMENTS IN A MATTER
THAT AFFECTS A SENSE OF BEAUTY.
艺术是有意识的安排
事物中的元素
这会影响美感。

23:59.888 --> 24:01.306
Lord Royal Highness:
NOT EVEN CLOSE.
殿下：
甚至还没有接近。

24:01.389 --> 24:06.603
ART IS WHAT HAPPENS
WHEN YOU LEARN TO DREAM.
艺术就是发生的事情
当你学会梦想时。

24:06.686 --> 24:07.854
GO AHEAD.
前进。

24:07.937 --> 24:12.483
DREAM A LITTLE.
梦想一点。

24:12.567 --> 24:15.153
IT LOOKS LIKE MY FRONT DOOR.
它看起来像我的前门。

24:15.236 --> 24:20.408
BEHOLD, THE HALL OF ARTS.
看哪，艺术殿堂。

24:20.491 --> 24:25.788
INCREDIBLE.
极好的。

24:28.416 --> 24:30.752
THE CREATIVITY.
创造力。

24:30.835 --> 24:32.003
THE ARTISTRY.
艺术性。

24:32.086 --> 24:34.380
THIS PAINTING IS SO REALISTIC.
这幅画太逼真了。

24:34.464 --> 24:36.633
IT LOOKS LIKE YOU COULD
STEP STRAIGHT INTO IT.
看起来你可以
直接进入其中。

24:36.716 --> 24:38.509
AND YOU CAN.
你可以。

24:41.971 --> 24:43.514
WHOA.
哇哦。

24:43.598 --> 24:46.976
THIS PLACE IS AMAZING.
这个地方太棒了。

24:47.060 --> 24:48.186
♪ ISN'T THIS GREAT? ♪
♪ 这不是很棒吗？ ♪

24:48.269 --> 24:49.687
♪ ISN'T THIS NEAT? ♪
♪ 这不是很漂亮吗？ ♪

24:49.771 --> 24:50.939
♪ I'M A LIVING WORK OF ART ♪
♪ 我是一件活生生的艺术品 ♪

24:51.022 --> 24:52.690
♪ FROM MY HEAD TO MY FEET ♪
♪ 从我的头到我的脚 ♪

24:52.774 --> 24:57.195
♪ FROM THE VERY FIRST DRAWINGS
ON WALLS IN CAVES ♪
♪ 从第一张图开始
洞穴墙壁上 ♪

24:57.278 --> 25:00.365
♪ ART HAS BEEN WHAT
THE HEART AND SOUL CRAVES ♪
♪ 艺术是什么
心灵和灵魂的渴望♪

25:00.448 --> 25:03.701
♪ SO PICK UP A BRUSH,
A PENCIL, OR PEN ♪
♪ 所以拿起画笔，
铅笔，或者钢笔 ♪

25:03.785 --> 25:07.497
♪ IF YOU DON'T LIKE THIS ONE,
PAINT IT AGAIN ♪
♪ 如果您不喜欢这个，
再画一遍♪

25:07.580 --> 25:11.376
♪ FROM NOW ON,
PLEASE CALL ME "SIR REAL" ♪
♪ 从现在开始，
请叫我“真实先生”♪

25:11.459 --> 25:14.587
♪ I CAN WAIT FOR YOUR IMPRESSION
TO CONGEAL ♪
♪ 我可以等待你的印象
凝结♪

25:14.671 --> 25:18.258
♪ TAKE IT FROM
AN UNDERSEA RENAISSANCE MAN ♪
♪ 从
海底文艺复兴人 ♪

25:18.341 --> 25:21.719
♪ I'D EVEN LOOK GREAT
ON THE SIDE OF YOUR VAN ♪
♪ 我什至会看起来很棒
在您的货车侧面 ♪

25:21.803 --> 25:23.221
♪ ANY WAY YOU CARVE IT ♪
♪ 随心所欲 ♪

25:23.304 --> 25:25.473
♪ I AM ART, AND ART IS ME ♪
♪ 我就是艺术，艺术就是我 ♪

25:25.556 --> 25:29.894
♪ ASK YOUR MAMA OR YOUR DADA
TO TELL YOU ABOUT
THE, UH, SCHISM ♪
♪ 问问你的妈妈或爸爸
告诉你关于
呃，分裂主义 ♪

25:29.978 --> 25:32.563
♪ BETWEEN MINIMALISM
AND CUBISM ♪
♪ 极简主义之间
还有立体主义♪

25:32.647 --> 25:35.900
♪ MY PERSONALITY MAY BE OF
THE CYNICAL TYPE ♪
♪ 我的性格可能是
愤世嫉俗的类型♪

25:35.984 --> 25:39.487
♪ BUT I FINALLY FOUND SOMETHING
THAT LIVES UP TO THE HYPE ♪
♪ 但我终于找到了一些东西
不负众望 ♪

25:39.570 --> 25:43.199
♪ I CAN SAY HONESTLY,
AND WITH GREAT CERTAINTY ♪
♪ 我可以诚实地说，
并且非常确定 ♪

25:43.283 --> 25:49.998
♪ THAT ATLANTIS IS WHERE
I WANT TO SPEND ETERNITY... ♪
♪ 亚特兰蒂斯在哪里
我想度过永恒……♪

25:57.797 --> 25:59.257
HEY, CAN YOU NOT SING?
嘿，你不能唱歌吗？

25:59.340 --> 26:00.758
I'M TRYING TO MODEL HERE.
我正在尝试在这里建模。

26:00.842 --> 26:02.260
NOW, HOLD ON, NANDO.
现在，坚持住，南多。

26:02.343 --> 26:03.970
WHY DON'T YOU TAKE FIVE?
你为什么不拿五个呢？

26:04.053 --> 26:05.930
I'M REALLY DIGGING
THIS SQUID'S FORM.
我真的在挖
这鱿鱼的形状。

26:08.141 --> 26:13.104
LOOKS LIKE I'LL BE HERE
INSPIRING THESE ATLANTEAN
ART MAKERS WITH MY BEAUTY.
看起来我会在这里
激励这些亚特兰蒂斯人
艺术创作者与我的美丽。

26:13.187 --> 26:15.106
YOU GUYS, GO ON AHEAD.
你们，继续前进。

26:15.189 --> 26:18.818
OK, BYE, SQUIDWARD.
好的，再见，章鱼哥。

26:18.901 --> 26:23.740
NOW, THIS SECTION OF TOWN
IS KNOWN FOR ITS ADVANCES
IN THE SCIENCE OF FONDUE CREAM.
现在，城镇的这一部分
以其先进性而闻名
火锅奶油的科学。

26:23.823 --> 26:25.742
EXCUSE ME, SIR.
对不起，先生。

26:25.825 --> 26:28.077
THIS TOUR'S BEEN GREAT AND ALL,
BUT, UH, CAN WE SEE
THE BUBBLE NOW?
这次旅行非常棒，
但是，呃，我们能看到吗
现在有泡沫吗？

26:28.161 --> 26:29.620
DO EXCUSE ME.
请原谅我。

26:29.704 --> 26:32.832
MOST FOLKS DON'T STAY
WITH THE TOUR THIS LONG.
大多数人不会留下来
巡演这么长。

26:32.915 --> 26:34.083
OF COURSE YOU CAN.
当然可以。

26:34.167 --> 26:35.668
BUT FIRST, REMEMBER THIS.
但首先，请记住这一点。

26:35.752 --> 26:38.921
THIS BUBBLE IS OVER
ONE MILLION YEARS OLD.
这个泡沫已经结束了
一百万年历史。

26:39.005 --> 26:43.176
IT WAS BROUGHT HERE
WHEN THE FIRST ATLANTEANS
COLONIZED THIS PLACE
它被带到这里
当第一个亚特兰蒂斯人
殖民这个地方

26:43.259 --> 26:49.265
DEFTLY HAND-CARRIED
OVER BILLIONS OF LIGHT YEARS
FROM OUR HOME PLANET.
灵巧手提
超过数十亿光年
来自我们的星球。

26:49.349 --> 26:56.147
IT IS OUR PEOPLE'S MOST BELOVED
AND TREASURED ANCIENT RELIC.
这是我们人民最喜爱的
和珍贵的古代遗迹。

26:56.230 --> 27:00.485
BUT MOST IMPORTANTLY,
REMEMBER TO...
但最重要的是，
记住...

27:00.568 --> 27:04.030
HAVE FUN.
玩得开心。

27:05.323 --> 27:06.949
THERE IT IS, PATRICK.
就是这样，帕特里克。

27:07.033 --> 27:10.536
THE WORLD'S
OLDEST LIVING BUBBLE.
世界的
最古老的现存泡沫。

27:10.620 --> 27:12.997
WHOO!
哇！

27:14.207 --> 27:15.124
LOOK AT IT, PATRICK.
看看它，帕特里克。

27:15.208 --> 27:17.168
SO ANCIENT, SO FLOATY.
如此古老，如此飘逸。

27:17.251 --> 27:21.089
IT IS THE MOST BEAUTIFUL,
WRINKLED-UP, DUSTY OLD BUBBLE
I'VE EVER SEEN.
这是最美丽的，
起皱、布满灰尘的旧气泡
我见过。

27:21.172 --> 27:25.551
LIKE A DELICATE AIR RAISIN.
就像精致的空气葡萄干。

27:25.635 --> 27:29.847
NOW, IF YOU'LL EXCUSE ME,
I NEED TO MAKE READY
FOR TONIGHT'S DINNER
现在，请原谅我，
我需要做好准备
今晚的晚餐

27:29.931 --> 27:34.685
SO I'M JUST GOING TO LEAVE
YOU TWO FRIENDLY STRANGERS ALONE
所以我要离开
你们两个友好的陌生人

27:34.769 --> 27:40.400
WITH OUR MOST BELOVED ANCIENT
AND FRAGILE ATLANTEAN RELIC.
与我们最喜爱的古代人一起
和脆弱的亚特兰蒂斯遗迹。

27:40.483 --> 27:43.528
JOIN US IN THE DINING HALL
WHEN YOU'VE HAD AN EYEFUL.
加入我们的餐厅
当你有一双眼睛时。

27:43.611 --> 27:46.656
THANK YOU,
MR. LORD ROYAL HIGHNESS, SIR.
谢谢你，
先生。殿下，先生。

27:46.739 --> 27:48.199
JUST LOOK AT IT, PATRICK.
看看它，帕特里克。

27:48.282 --> 27:50.576
AH, THE STORIES
THIS BUBBLE COULD TELL.
啊，故事
这个泡沫可以说明一切。

27:50.660 --> 27:53.037
I JUST WISH WE COULD GET
A CLOSER LOOK.
我只是希望我们能得到
仔细看看。

27:53.121 --> 27:54.038
OH...
哦...

27:54.122 --> 27:55.039
PATRICK, CATCH THE...!
帕特里克，抓住……！

27:55.123 --> 27:56.082
OH, GOLLY!
哦，天哪！

27:57.583 --> 27:58.793
I DON'T KNOW HOW MUCH LONGER
I CAN HOLD THIS!
我不知道还要多久
我能坚持住！

28:00.962 --> 28:02.964
WHOA!
哇啊！

28:18.271 --> 28:20.773
WHOO, THAT WAS
A CLOSE ONE, BUDDY.
哇，那是
一个亲密的人，伙计。

28:20.857 --> 28:24.569
YEAH, WE ALMOST POPPED
THE MOST PRIZED POSSESSION
OF ALL ATLANTIS.
是的，我们差一点就爆了
最珍贵的财产
整个亚特兰蒂斯。

28:26.362 --> 28:29.407
BOY, THAT WOULD'VE BEEN
OUR GREATEST BLUNDER,
WITHOUT A DOUBT.
男孩，那本来就是
我们最大的错误，
毫无疑问。

28:29.490 --> 28:31.409
WE SHOULD GO BEFORE
SOMETHING BAD DOES HAPPEN.
我们应该先走
确实发生了不好的事情。

28:31.492 --> 28:34.036
LET'S GET A PICTURE FOR
OUR SCRAPBOOKS BEFORE WE LEAVE.
让我们拍一张照片
出发前我们的剪贴簿。

28:34.120 --> 28:35.580
GREAT IDEA, PATRICK.
好主意，帕特里克。

28:35.663 --> 28:39.375
CHEESE.
奶酪。

28:39.459 --> 28:42.378
PATRICK, DID YOU HEAR SOMETHING?
帕特里克，你听到什么了吗？

28:42.462 --> 28:45.423
UH, SORT OF A POPPING SOUND?
呃，有点爆裂声？

28:45.506 --> 28:48.259
MM-HMM.
嗯嗯。

28:53.347 --> 28:54.557
SO SORRY I'M LATE.
很抱歉我迟到了。

28:54.640 --> 28:56.809
THE TOUR RAN A LITTLE LONG.
巡演时间有点长。

28:56.893 --> 28:59.854
SO, HOW ARE YOU ALL ENJOYING
OUR BELOVED CITY?
那么，你们都玩得怎么样
我们心爱的城市？

28:59.937 --> 29:02.690
I'M NEVER LEAVING THIS PLACE.
我永远不会离开这个地方。

29:02.773 --> 29:05.234
I'VE LEARNED MORE ABOUT PAINTING
IN A FEW HOURS HERE
我学到了更多关于绘画的知识
几个小时后

29:05.318 --> 29:07.945
THAN I DID IN FOUR YEARS
OF COMMUNITY COLLEGE.
比我四年来的成绩
社区学院。

29:08.029 --> 29:10.823
ABSOLUTELY MARVELOUS.
绝对棒极了。

29:10.907 --> 29:15.536
AND, EUGENE, I ASSUME
THE HALL OF TREASURE
WAS EVERYTHING YOU HOPED FOR?
而且，尤金，我想
宝藏大厅
你所希望的一切都实现了吗？

29:17.914 --> 29:21.959
AND, SANDRA, HOW DID YOU FIND
OUR LABORATORIES?
还有，桑德拉，你是怎么找到的
我们的实验室？

29:22.043 --> 29:23.586
THEY ARE JUST AMAZING.
他们真是太棒了。

29:23.669 --> 29:25.838
I USED YOUR INVENTION ROOM
TO MAKE THIS.
我用过你的发明室
为了做到这一点。

29:25.922 --> 29:27.048
SPLENDID.
灿烂。

29:27.131 --> 29:28.132
WHAT DOES IT DO?
它有什么作用？

29:28.216 --> 29:30.635
I'LL SHOW YOU.
我会告诉你。

29:35.056 --> 29:37.808
NOW I CAN EAT UNDERWATER
WITHOUT REMOVING MY HELMET.
现在我可以在水下吃饭了
无需摘下头盔。

29:37.892 --> 29:39.560
THIS IS JUST THE BEGINNING.
这只是开始。

29:39.644 --> 29:41.687
I SHOULD HAVE A CURE
FOR THE COMMON COLD
我应该得到治愈
对于普通感冒

29:41.771 --> 29:44.023
UP AND RUNNING
BY TOMORROW AFTERNOON
WITH YOUR HIGH-TECH LAB.
启动并运行
明天下午之前
与您的高科技实验室一起。

29:46.234 --> 29:51.405
SPONGEBOB, PATRICK, TELL ME,
HOW DID YOU ENJOY OUR RAREST
AND MOST PRIZED POSSESSION?
海绵宝宝，帕特里克，告诉我，
您喜欢我们最稀有的产品吗？
最珍贵的财产？

29:51.489 --> 29:54.116
UM, WE HAVE TO GO BACK
TO BIKINI BOTTOM NOW.
嗯，我们得回去了
现在到比基尼底部。

29:54.200 --> 29:55.117
HUH?
嗯？

29:55.201 --> 29:56.118
HUH?
嗯？

29:58.120 --> 30:02.333
COME, ENJOY THE BEST
ATLANTEAN CUISINE HAS TO OFFER
BEFORE YOU GO.
来吧，享受最好的
亚特兰蒂斯美食
出发之前。

30:04.377 --> 30:05.836
WHAT IS WRONG
WITH YOU TWO MORONS?
出了什么问题
和你们两个白痴一起？

30:05.920 --> 30:07.630
WE HAVE TO GO HOME NOW.
我们现在必须回家了。

30:07.713 --> 30:10.383
WHY WOULD YOU WANT TO LEAVE
A PARADISE LIKE ATLANTIS?
你为什么想离开
像亚特兰蒂斯一样的天堂？

30:10.466 --> 30:13.844
BECAUSE, UH, GARY MISSES ME.
因为，呃，加里想念我。

30:16.597 --> 30:20.851
WE DESTROYED
YOUR MOST PRIZED POSSESSION!
我们摧毁了
您最珍贵的财产！

30:25.648 --> 30:30.611
IF THERE'S ONE THING
WE ATLANTEANS ENJOY, IT'S
A HEALTHY DOSE OF DARK HUMOR.
如果有一件事
我们亚特兰蒂斯人很享受，它是
健康剂量的黑色幽默。

30:31.696 --> 30:32.780
IT'S NOT A JOKE.
这不是玩笑。

30:32.863 --> 30:33.864
WE BURST THE BUBBLE!
我们打破泡沫！

30:36.200 --> 30:38.035
THAT'S NOT THE REAL BUBBLE.
这不是真正的泡沫。

30:38.119 --> 30:41.372
IT'S JUST A PROP
FOR THE TOURISTS.
这只是一个道具
对于游客。

30:41.455 --> 30:43.666
THIS IS THE REAL DEAL.
这是真正的交易。

30:43.749 --> 30:45.918
OOH.
哦。

30:48.879 --> 30:52.341
SUMMON THE
ATLANTEAN ROYAL GUARD.
召唤
亚特兰蒂斯皇家卫队。

31:01.726 --> 31:04.645
SEIZE THESE
HOSTILE BUBBLE-POPPERS.
抓住这些
敌对的吹泡泡者。

31:07.189 --> 31:08.816
DON'T JUST STAND THERE.
不要只是站在那里。

31:08.899 --> 31:13.112
MOVE!
移动！

31:13.195 --> 31:15.615
CAN'T YOU GO ANY FASTER, SANDY?
桑迪，你就不能走快一点吗？

31:15.698 --> 31:19.243
MAYBE, IF Y'ALL
WOULD USE YOUR FEET.
也许吧，如果你们都的话
会用你的脚。

31:19.327 --> 31:20.661
NEVER MIND.
没关系。

31:20.745 --> 31:21.912
JUST KEEP DOING
WHAT YOU'RE DOING.
继续做
你在做什么。

31:23.164 --> 31:27.084
HUH?
嗯？

31:31.339 --> 31:35.843
COME ON, PATRICK.
来吧，帕特里克。

31:37.553 --> 31:38.763
THAT TICKLES.
很痒。

31:40.139 --> 31:42.433
HANG IN THERE, LITTLE BUDDY.
坚持住，小伙伴。

31:51.817 --> 31:54.445
HUH?
嗯？

31:54.528 --> 31:56.280
DON'T LET THEM GET AWAY.
不要让他们逃跑。

32:11.754 --> 32:14.840
THIS IS THE END OF PATCHY.
这就是斑驳的结局。

32:14.924 --> 32:18.302
NO WATER, NO FOOD,
没有水，没有食物，

32:18.386 --> 32:21.806
AND STILL NO ENCINO.
仍然没有恩西诺。

32:21.889 --> 32:26.477
HERE COME THE VULTURES
TO PICK ME BONES.
秃鹫来了
给我挑骨头。

32:27.853 --> 32:31.148
SHIVER ME TIMBERS, IT'S POTTY.
木材让我颤抖，它是便盆。

32:31.232 --> 32:33.025
I WONDER WHAT PARROT
TASTES LIKE.
我想知道什么鹦鹉
味道像。

32:34.193 --> 32:35.778
COME BACK HERE.
回到这里。

32:35.861 --> 32:39.949
UH-OH, HERE COME
THE HALLUCINATIONS.
呃-哦，来了
幻觉。

32:50.918 --> 32:55.089
PATCHY, IT'S ME,
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
帕奇，是我，
海绵宝宝。

33:00.261 --> 33:02.221
DON'T LOSE HOPE.
不要失去希望。

33:02.304 --> 33:06.183
EVERYTHING WILL BE ALL RIGHT,
WHEN YOU GET TO ENCINO.
一切都会好起来的，
当您到达恩西诺时。

33:06.267 --> 33:10.396
BUT ENCINO IS GONE.
但恩西诺已经走了。

33:10.479 --> 33:16.527
IT'S NOT GONE, IF YOU BELIEVE.
如果你相信的话，它还没有消失。

33:16.610 --> 33:21.866
BELIEVE... BELIEVE.
相信...相信。

33:27.329 --> 33:28.914
WELCOME TO ENCINO.
欢迎来到恩西诺。

33:28.998 --> 33:30.624
IT'S BACK.
它回来了。

33:30.708 --> 33:33.294
SPONGEBOB WAS RIGHT.
海绵宝宝是对的。

33:33.377 --> 33:36.547
ALL I HAD TO DO WAS BELIEVE.
我所要做的就是相信。

33:39.425 --> 33:40.551
Man: ♪ WAS OUT OF SIGHT ♪
男人：♪ 看不见了 ♪

33:40.634 --> 33:41.761
♪ YOU GOT TO BELIEVE ♪
♪ 你必须相信 ♪

33:41.844 --> 33:43.304
♪ I'M BACK IN ENCINO ♪
♪ 我回到恩西诺 ♪

33:43.387 --> 33:44.513
♪ YOU GOT TO BELIEVE ♪
♪ 你必须相信 ♪

33:44.597 --> 33:46.766
♪ AND EVERYTHING'S ALL RIGHT ♪
♪ 一切都好 ♪

33:46.849 --> 33:49.810
♪ THE SKY ABOVE
AND GROUND BELOW ♪
♪ 头顶的天空
还有下面的地面 ♪

33:49.894 --> 33:53.063
♪ BRING ME BACK IN ENCINO ♪
♪ 带我回到恩西诺 ♪

33:53.147 --> 33:55.941
♪ IT WAS LOST SOME TIME AGO ♪
♪ 它以前丢失过一段时间 ♪

33:56.025 --> 33:58.944
♪ JUST GLAD TO BE BACK HOME ♪
♪ 很高兴回到家 ♪

34:05.493 --> 34:06.619
♪ YOU GOT TO BELIEVE ♪
♪ 你必须相信 ♪

34:06.702 --> 34:08.746
♪ I'M BACK IN ENCINO ♪
♪ 我回到恩西诺 ♪

34:08.829 --> 34:09.955
♪ YOU GOT TO BELIEVE ♪
♪ 你必须相信 ♪

34:10.039 --> 34:11.749
♪ IT WAS OUT OF SIGHT ♪
♪ 它看不见了 ♪

34:11.832 --> 34:12.917
♪ YOU GOT TO BELIEVE ♪
♪ 你必须相信 ♪

34:13.000 --> 34:14.585
♪ I'M BACK IN ENCINO ♪
♪ 我回到恩西诺 ♪

34:14.668 --> 34:15.878
♪ YOU GOT TO BELIEVE ♪
♪ 你必须相信 ♪

34:15.961 --> 34:18.589
♪ AND EVERYTHING'S ALL RIGHT ♪
♪ 一切都好 ♪

34:27.431 --> 34:28.557
♪ YOU GOT TO BELIEVE ♪
♪ 你必须相信 ♪

34:28.641 --> 34:29.809
♪ I'M BACK IN ENCINO ♪
♪ 我回到恩西诺 ♪

34:29.892 --> 34:30.935
♪ YOU GOT TO BELIEVE ♪
♪ 你必须相信 ♪

34:31.018 --> 34:32.770
♪ IT WAS OUT OF SIGHT ♪
♪ 它看不见了 ♪

34:32.853 --> 34:34.647
♪ YOU GOT TO BELIEVE ♪
♪ 你必须相信 ♪

34:34.730 --> 34:35.773
♪ I'M BACK IN ENCINO ♪
♪ 我回到恩西诺 ♪

34:35.856 --> 34:37.024
♪ YOU GOT... ♪
♪ 你有... ♪

34:53.749 --> 34:59.630
OW, OW, OW, OW!
噢，噢，噢，噢！

34:59.713 --> 35:04.134
OH... IT WAS ALL
A HALLUCINATION.
哦...这就是全部
幻觉。

35:04.218 --> 35:07.096
ENCINO'S STILL GONE.
恩西诺还是走了。

35:13.602 --> 35:15.855
OOH, A SANDWICH.
哦，一个三明治。

35:15.938 --> 35:19.191
POTTY, YOU'RE A LIFE SAVER.
波蒂，你是一个救星。

35:22.528 --> 35:23.737
OH!
哦！

35:23.821 --> 35:27.992
POTTY, YOU KNOW
I DON'T LIKE MAYO!
便盆，你知道的
我不喜欢梅奥！

35:31.871 --> 35:33.414
HERE, YOU WANT SOME?
在这里，您想要一些吗？

35:33.497 --> 35:35.249
GO ON.
继续。

35:35.332 --> 35:37.293
UH, TAKE IT.
呃，拿走它。

35:37.376 --> 35:40.629
I DON'T LIKE THE MAYONNAISE,
YOU KNOW.
我不喜欢蛋黄酱，
你知道。

35:40.713 --> 35:47.177
ONCE IT GETS UP ABOVE 130, 135,
THE MAYONNAISE GETS
KIND OF GRODY, YOU KNOW.
一旦升至 130、135 以上，
蛋黄酱得到
你知道，有点格鲁迪。

35:48.804 --> 35:50.848
COWER TO ME, FOOLS.
向我退缩吧，傻瓜们。

35:50.931 --> 35:56.061
I HAVE COMMANDEERED
THE MOST POWERFUL WEAPON
IN THE ATLANTEAN ARSENAL.
我已命令
最强大的武器
在亚特兰蒂斯兵工厂。

35:56.145 --> 35:59.857
NOW, BOW BEFORE
THE NEW KING OF ATLANTIS.
现在，鞠躬
亚特兰蒂斯的新国王。

35:59.940 --> 36:03.027
THEN, PREPARE TO TASTE MY WRATH.
那么，准备好尝尝我的愤怒吧。

36:04.194 --> 36:05.696
HUH?
嗯？

36:05.779 --> 36:09.033
UH, I MEAN, PREPARE
TO TASTE MY WRATH.
呃，我的意思是，准备
尝尝我的愤怒。

36:11.118 --> 36:12.036
YOU...
你...

36:13.329 --> 36:16.290
PREPARE TO TASTE MY WRATH.
准备好尝尝我的愤怒吧。

36:17.791 --> 36:19.835
Computer voice: LAUNCH
SEQUENCE DEPLOYED.
电脑语音：启动
序列已部署。

36:28.010 --> 36:30.721
OOH!
哦！

36:32.973 --> 36:35.309
PLANKTON'S WRATH
TASTES LIKE ICE CREAM.
浮游生物的愤怒
味道像冰淇淋。

36:35.392 --> 36:37.895
THANKS, PLANKTON.
谢谢，浮游生物。

36:37.978 --> 36:39.229
Plankton: ICE CREAM?
浮游生物：冰淇淋？

36:39.313 --> 36:41.357
IT SHOOTS ICE CREAM?
它会射冰淇淋？

36:42.691 --> 36:46.362
OVERSIZED ICE CREAM MAKER!
超大冰淇淋机！

36:48.155 --> 36:50.491
OUCH, OUCH.
哎哟，哎哟。

36:50.574 --> 36:52.326
LOOK, A TALKING SPECK.
看，一个会说话的幽灵。

36:52.409 --> 36:56.080
THIS TALKING SPECK WILL MAKE
A FANTASTIC REPLACEMENT
这个会说话的斑点将使
绝佳的替代品

36:56.163 --> 36:58.999
FOR OUR RECENTLY DEFLATED
NATIONAL TREASURE.
对于我们最近泄气的
国宝。

36:59.083 --> 37:01.252
WON'T YOU, LITTLE FELLOW?
你不会吗，小家伙？

37:01.335 --> 37:03.212
I'LL DESTROY ALL OF YOU!
我会毁掉你们所有人！

37:03.295 --> 37:04.630
AMAZING.
惊人的。

37:04.713 --> 37:06.966
THIS IS SO MUCH BETTER
THAN THAT DUSTY OLD BUBBLE.
这好多了
比那个布满灰尘的旧泡沫。

37:07.049 --> 37:10.219
YOU HAVEN'T SEEN THE LAST OF ME.
你还没有看到我的最后一面。

37:10.302 --> 37:13.639
WHEN I GET OUT OF HERE,
I'LL HUNT YOU ALL DOWN
LIKE A PACK OF...
当我离开这里时
我会追捕你们所有人
就像一包...

37:13.722 --> 37:14.640
HEY.
嘿。

37:14.723 --> 37:15.808
CAN'T YOU READ?
你不识字吗？

37:15.891 --> 37:17.267
NO FLASH PHOTOGRAPHY.
禁止使用闪光灯拍照。

37:19.979 --> 37:21.981
SO NICE TO MEET YOU ALL.
很高兴认识大家。

37:22.064 --> 37:27.361
I HOPE YOU HAVE
A SAFE JOURNEY BACK HOME,
AND DO COME BACK ANY TIME.
我希望你有
安全回家，
并且随时回来。

37:27.444 --> 37:28.529
SO LONG.
这么久。

37:28.612 --> 37:32.533
AND THANKS FOR THE TOUR.
感谢您的参观。

37:32.616 --> 37:34.118
DISPOSE OF THIS, QUICKLY.
快速处理掉这个。

37:34.201 --> 37:37.371
WE CAN'T SURVIVE
ANY MORE VISITORS LIKE THESE.
我们无法生存
还有更多像这样的访客。

37:37.454 --> 37:38.747
SIR, YES, SIR.
先生，是的，先生。

37:50.301 --> 37:54.388
I THOUGHT SPONGES WERE SUPPOSED
TO MAKE LIFE EASIER.
我以为应该是海绵
让生活更轻松。

37:58.559 --> 38:01.770
♪ GOODBYE, ATLANTIS ♪
♪ 再见，亚特兰蒂斯 ♪

38:01.854 --> 38:05.899
♪ BUT WE REALLY HAVE TO GO ♪
♪ 但我们真的必须走了 ♪

38:05.983 --> 38:08.527
♪ BACK TO A LITTLE TOWN ♪
♪ 回到小镇 ♪

38:08.610 --> 38:15.159
♪ THAT IS THE GREATEST PLACE
I KNOW ♪
♪ 那是最棒的地方
我知道♪

38:16.744 --> 38:17.995
♪ BACK TO BIKINI BOTTOM ♪
♪ 回到比基尼泳裤 ♪

38:18.078 --> 38:19.330
♪ I CAN HARDLY WAIT ♪
♪ 我已经等不及了 ♪

38:19.413 --> 38:20.998
♪ BUT WHAT ABOUT THE TREASURE? ♪
♪ 那么宝藏呢？ ♪

38:21.081 --> 38:22.791
♪ IT WAS REALLY GREAT ♪
♪ 真的很棒 ♪

38:22.875 --> 38:24.043
♪ I LOVE BIKINI BOTTOM ♪
♪ 我喜欢比基尼泳裤 ♪

38:24.126 --> 38:26.045
♪ IT'S WHERE MY GARY IS ♪
♪ 这就是我的加里所在的地方 ♪

38:26.128 --> 38:28.756
♪ BUT ATLANTIS HAD
THAT SCIENCE STUFF,
AT WHICH I WAS A WIZ ♪
♪ 但亚特兰蒂斯有
那些科学的东西，
我是一个奇才 ♪

38:28.839 --> 38:30.049
♪ SOON, I'LL SEE
THE KRUSTY KRAB ♪
♪ 很快我就会看到
脆皮蟹♪

38:30.132 --> 38:34.094
♪ WHERE I'M HAPPILY EMPLOYED ♪
♪ 我快乐工作的地方 ♪

38:34.178 --> 38:36.680
♪ BUT ATLANTIS HAD
THE OLDEST BUBBLE ♪
♪ 但亚特兰蒂斯有
最古老的泡沫♪

38:36.764 --> 38:39.808
♪ WHICH I CRUELLY DESTROYED ♪
♪ 我残忍地摧毁了它 ♪

38:39.892 --> 38:42.019
♪ YOU CAN'T BEAT BIKINI BOTTOM ♪
♪ 你无法打败比基尼泳裤 ♪

38:42.102 --> 38:43.687
♪ NO PLACE IS SO NICE ♪
♪ 没有一个地方这么好 ♪

38:43.771 --> 38:46.565
♪ BUT ATLANTIS WAS
A FABULOUS ARTISTIC PARADISE ♪
♪ 但亚特兰蒂斯是
美妙的艺术天堂♪

38:46.648 --> 38:49.693
♪ SORRY, SQUIDWARD,
BUT IT'S THE END
OF OUR ATLANTEAN VACATION ♪
♪ 对不起，章鱼哥，
但这是结束
我们的亚特兰蒂斯假期 ♪

38:49.777 --> 38:52.696
♪ AND BACK TO MY DEPRESSING LIFE
OF QUIET DESPERATION ♪
♪ 回到我压抑的生活
平静的绝望♪

38:52.780 --> 38:54.198
SpongeBob: ♪ GOODBYE, ATLANTIS ♪
海绵宝宝：♪ 再见，亚特兰蒂斯 ♪

38:54.281 --> 38:56.366
♪ WE'RE BIKINI BOTTOM BOUND ♪
♪ 我们是比基尼下装 ♪

38:56.450 --> 38:58.118
♪ PLEASE TURN THIS BUS AROUND ♪
♪ 请让这辆巴士掉头 ♪

38:58.202 --> 38:59.495
